[ti:The World Grew Quiet]
[ar:Giuntru]
[re:Automatic line alignment - listening review pending]
[00:09.54]I remember
[00:11.08]The day the noise grew thin
[00:14.04]As if the world had opened
[00:17.54]A quieter way in
[00:19.72]Not empty, not lonely
[00:23.78]Not waiting for a sign
[00:26.22]Just a little wider
[00:28.34]When your eyes met mine
[00:31.66]No thunder in the distance
[00:35.92]No sudden change of sky
[00:38.58]Only something gentle
[00:41.56]Moving into light
[00:44.16]The world grew quiet
[00:48.34]When you came near
[00:50.72]Not because it ended
[00:53.66]But because it became clear
[00:56.38]The world grew quiet
[00:59.30]And I could feel
[01:01.70]Something almost weightless
[01:04.82]Beginning to be real
[01:16.26]I remember
[01:18.04]How nothing had to start
[01:20.86]Yet every ordinary second
[01:24.22]Made more room inside my heart
[01:27.60]You didn’t force the doorway
[01:30.28]You didn’t ask to stay
[01:32.78]You only brought a softness
[01:35.48]That changed the shape of day
[01:38.78]The world grew quiet
[01:41.42]When you came near
[01:43.88]Not because it ended
[01:46.72]But because it became clear
[01:49.84]The world grew quiet
[01:52.32]And I could feel
[01:55.14]Something almost weightless
[01:58.08]Beginning to be real
[02:04.44]Maybe chance was listening
[02:06.10]Maybe stars aligned
[02:08.70]Maybe we just noticed
[02:11.48]What was already kind
[02:14.32]No need to explain it
[02:17.20]No need to make it stay
[02:19.60]Some lights begin softly
[02:22.44]And still change every day
[02:25.40]The world grew quiet
[02:30.04]Not empty, not still
[02:33.22]Only wide enough
[02:35.72]For wonder to fill
[02:39.88]
